or%29%20%7B%0A%20%20if%20%28widening%29%20return%20%27exact%27%3B%0A%20%20return%20language%20%3D%3D%3D%20%27Rust%27%20%7C%7C%20flavor%20%3D%3D%3D%20%27wrapping%27%20%3F%20%27wrapping%27%20%3A%20%27%27%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2A%2A%20%40returns%20%7Bstring%7D%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20readFixedIntegerCastStatement%28%29%20%7B%0A%20%20return%20%27Fixed%20width%20integer%20casts%20retain%20low%20bits%20at%20the%20target%20width%20and%20interpret%20its%20sign%20bit%20for%20signed%20targets%2C%20without%20integer%20rounding%20through%20binary64.%27%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2A%2A%20Complete%20mathematical%20operation%3B%20no%20binary64%20integer%20conversion.%0A%20%2A%20%40param%20%7Bbigint%7D%20value%20%40param%20%7Bnumber%7D%20bits%20%40param%20%7Bboolean%7D%20signed%20%40returns%20%7Bbigint%7D%0A%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20wrapFixedIntegerBits%28value%2C%20bits%2C%20signed%29%20%7B%0A%20%20if%20%28%21acceptFixedIntegerCastWidth%28bits%29%29%20throw%20new%20RangeError%28%27unsupported%20fixed%20integer%20cast%20width%27%29%3B%0A%20%20let%20modulus%20%3D%201n%3B%0A%20%20for%20%28let%20bit%20%3D%200%3B%20bit%20%3C%20bits%3B%20bit%20%2B%3D%201%29%20modulus%20%2A%3D%202n%3B%0A%20%20let%20residue%20%3D%20value%20%25%20modulus%3B%0A%20%20if%20%28residue%20%3C%200n%29%20residue%20%2B%3D%20modulus%3B%0A%20%20return%20signed%20%26%26%20residue%20%3E%3D%20modulus%20%2F%202n%20%3F%20residue%20-%20modulus%20%3A%20residue%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2A%2A%20Postorder%20construction%20of%20the%20same%20operation%20using%20existing%20integer%20terms.%0A%20%2A%20Each%20instruction%20occupies%20five%20cells%3A%20kind%2C%20value%2Foperator%2C%20first%2C%20second%2C%0A%20%2A%20third.%20References%20and%20let%20names%20use%20three%20fresh%20caller-owned%20binding%20slots.%0A%20%2A%20The%20value%20operand%20occurs%20once%2C%20and%20the%20result%20remains%20an%20unbounded%20integer.%0A%20%2A%20%40param%20%7Bnumber%7D%20bits%20%40param%20%7Bboolean%7D%20signed%20%40returns%20%7Bstring%5B%5D%7D%0A%20%2A%2F